# ============================================================
# Clinflux — local dev file storage
# ============================================================

# LocalFileStorageService's on-disk root for uploaded patient files (Storage:RootPath, default
# "App_Data/PatientFiles") when running the API locally via `dotnet run` — production instead uses
# a Docker-mounted volume at a different path (see docker-compose.prod.yml), so this only ever
# holds an individual developer's own local test uploads. Also covers the Data Protection key ring
# persisted under App_Data/PatientFiles/_dpkeys (encrypts MFA secrets at rest) and App_Data_tmp/,
# an equivalent scratch root used by some local/test runs.
src/Clinflux.Api/App_Data/
src/Clinflux.Api/App_Data_tmp/


